Rule 9 (padding mode should be reflect, replicate or circular)
{padding_mode : str} |= (padding_mode = "reflect") ∨ (padding_mode = "replicate") ∨ (padding_mode = "circular")
>>
Rule 10 (padding must be an integer when padding_mode is circular)
{padding : int, padding_mode : str} |= if padding_mode = "circular" then true
